    "renderer.mjs/surface-renderer.mjs/model-runtime.mjs: local raster-part hierarchy, held-object hand anchors and optional transient mechanical mouth; original art and saved rest cues remain unchanged at level zero.",
    "app.mjs/index.html/storage.mjs: explicit immutable saved-revision compact preview through existing actor-owned parent bridge; preview never saves, uses or awards a mission.",
    "Archive Enchanted presentation restored on current App: selected local licensed fonts/icons, ascii-avatar.exe header, grouped controls, face-focused expression thumbnails; preserve immutable API, preview/use, v2 mouth/hand rendering and pre-paint presentation bootstrap.",
    "Shared release consumer: full maintainer5967ee3 baseline reconciles the separately attributed Archive UI/header/artwork handoffs; retains actual PR771 artwork and existing account/raster/preview adapters.",
    "PR776 mission bridge composed with the existing App owner selection: clean saved-revision return/reopen; Use, actual participation, display review and Oca credit remain separate."
  ],
